    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "summary": "The team scoring more VP wins. Matching scores produce a draw. Each VP SOURCE has its own MAXIMUM VP. The PRIMARY MISSION can give 45VP overall, with a cap of 15VP for a round. SECONDARY MISSIONS can give 45VP overall and at most 15VP in a round. An army meeting the BATTLE READY ARMY standard earns 10VP. A Fixed Secondary Mission card can contribute up to 20VP to its category.",
